# The build context for `tests/docker/systemd/Dockerfile` is the repo root, because that is the
# only context reaching all four things the image needs: the shared stubs under
# `tests/docker/snapserver/`, `pyproject.toml` + `uv.lock` (the lock is the only place the
# `camilladsp-plot` git rev is pinned), the code under test, and the two `os/dietpi/lib/` files
# provisioning sources, since provisioning is that suite's fixture.
#
# The other two Dockerfiles build from their own directories, so Docker never consults this file
# for them: it reads the `.dockerignore` at the context root, and neither of those has one.
#
# Deny everything, then re-include, so a file added at the root later stays out of the image until
# somebody names it. `**` rather than `*`, since `*` does not match across `/`.
**

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md

!audera
!audera/**
!tests
!tests/**
!os/dietpi/lib/common.sh
!os/dietpi/lib/streamer.sh

# Re-excluded after the re-inclusions, since a later pattern wins. These byte caches are built
# against the host's interpreter and would otherwise be included by `tests/**` and `audera/**`.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
